  "brief": { "zh": "收齐月兔、狐狸和猫头鹰三张巡游面具。每辆花车只运一张尚未被拾取的面具。兔车在第 7 回合结束后进站，狐狸车在第 14 回合结束后转进东街，猫头鹰车在第 23 回合结束后抵达南广场。两台追击机和一台固定哨兵也在场。第 45 回合结束前完成收集。", "en": "Collect the Rabbit, Fox and Owl parade masks. Each float carries its mask only while it remains unclaimed. The Rabbit float reaches the station after turn 7, Fox turns onto East Street after turn 14, and Owl reaches South Square after turn 23. Two hunters and a fixed sentry are on duty. Collect the set by the end of turn 45." },
